# Proton Pass secret reference for the url-to-markdown skill.
# Copy to url-to-markdown.env (gitignored). Holds a reference, never a key.
#
# This file is OPTIONAL — url-to-markdown's tiers 0-3 (probe, static fetch,
# headless Chrome, Jina Reader) work with zero configuration. Only add this
# file if you want Tier 4 (Firecrawl) enabled as a last automatic escalation
# before the manual claude-in-chrome tier. See references/proton-pass-setup.md
# for one-time setup.
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=pass://Firecrawl/Firecrawl/API Key
